{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play the Right Card According to the Story's Progression</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a narrative-driven game that incorporates card-based gameplay. Featuring around 200 cards, the game follows a linear storyline where you must carefully read the plot description of each round, search for clues, and play the correct card to advance the story. Each round allows you to adjust part of your hand, and new plot developments will introduce new cards to help you deal with upcoming events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Logic and Judgment \u2013 Choose cards that fit the situation based on narrative hints</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523990/extras/screenshot01.jpg?t=1744906392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Dynamic Deck Adjustment \u2013 You can replace some cards each turn and receive new story cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523990/extras/screenshot02.jpg?t=1744906392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Story Review \u2013 Revisit past plot points to trace clues and support your decisions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523990/extras/screenshot04.jpg?t=1744906392\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Card Collection \u2013 Unlock and collect all cards featured in the story, and view detailed information about unlocked cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3523990/extras/screenshot05.jpg?t=1744906392\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3523990?t=1744906392","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor